asset: tests/fixtures/frag_h264.mp4
title: Fragmented MP4 (H.264) 64x48
author: Amrit Rosell — generated test pattern (bytes (offset + frame * 8) mod 256 in BGRA), no third-party content
source: Written by scripts/make-fragmented-mp4.swift with AVFoundation (AVAssetWriter, outputFileTypeProfile mpeg4CMAFCompliant, 1 s segments): the initialization segment (ftyp + moov whose sample tables are empty, stsz count 0, + mvex) followed by two media segments (moof + mdat), concatenated; 60 frames, 30 fps, H.264 (VideoToolbox)
